# Title: User Added to Remote Desktop Users Group
# ID: ffa28e60-bdb1-46e0-9f82-05f7a61cc06e
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-12-06
# Tags: attack.initial-access, attack.persistence, attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1133, attack.t1136.001, attack.t1021.001
# Description: Detects addition of users to the local Remote Desktop Users group via "Net" or "Add-LocalGroupMember".
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAIN "Remote Desktop Users" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Utilisateurs du Bureau à distance" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Usuarios de escritorio remoto")) AND (((CommandLine CONTAIN "localgroup " AND CommandLine CONTAIN " /add")) OR ((CommandLine CONTAIN "Add-LocalGroupMember " AND CommandLine CONTAIN " -Group "))))
